msgid "Enable"
msgstr "Nika amandla"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Disabled tag will not be shown in graph."
msgstr "Ithegi elikhutshaziwe ngeke liboniswe kugrafu."

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Hide tags in graphs"
msgstr "Fihla amathegi kumagrafu"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "If checked, plugin will not display tags in graphs"
msgstr "Uma kukhethiwe, isengezo ngeke sibonise amathegi kumagrafu"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Data Retention"
msgstr "Ukugcinwa Kwedatha"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "After this time, tags will be moved to the archive and will no longer be displayed"
msgstr "Ngemva kwalesi sikhathi, amathegi azoyiswa kungobo yomlando futhi ngeke esaboniswa"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Graph legend limit"
msgstr "Umkhawulo wencazelo yegrafu"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "If number of tags is bigger than limit, legend will be aggregated. Due to potential display issues, the number of vertical lines is limited to 5 times this value."
msgstr "Uma inani lamathegi likhulu kunomkhawulo, incazelo izohlanganiswa. Ngenxa yezinkinga zokubonisa ezingaba khona, inani lemigqa emile likhawulelwe izikhathi ezi-5 zaleli nani."

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Select Primary Device"
msgstr "Khetha Idivayisi Eyinhloko"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Typically a local Cacti device. Tags related to the Cacti system will be displayed here."
msgstr "Ngokuvamile yidivayisi ye-Cacti yendawo. Amathegi ahlobene nohlelo lwe-Cacti azoboniswa lapha."

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Automatic tags - host specific"
msgstr "Amathegi azenzakalelayo - aqondene nomsingathi"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Host restart automatic tag"
msgstr "Ithegi elizenzakalelayo lokuqalwa kabusha komsingathi"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "If checked, plugin will create automatic tag when device restarts"
msgstr "Uma kukhethiwe, isengezo sizodala ithegi elizenzakalelayo uma idivayisi iqala kabusha"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Host restart tag color"
msgstr "Umbala wethegi wokuqalwa kabusha komsingathi"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Recommendation: Use a different color for each automatic tag"
msgstr "Isincomo: Sebenzisa umbala ohlukile kuthegi ngalinye elizenzakalelayo"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Host added automatic tag. Will be displayed on 'Default' device and specific device"
msgstr "Ithegi elizenzakalelayo lokwengezwa komsingathi. Lizoboniswa kudivayisi ethi 'Okuzenzakalelayo' nakudivayisi ethile"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "If checked, plugin will create automatic tags when device is added"
msgstr "Uma kukhethiwe, isengezo sizodala amathegi azenzakalelayo uma kwengezwa idivayisi"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Host added tag color"
msgstr "Umbala wethegi wokwengezwa komsingathi"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Device save/change automatic tag"
msgstr "Ithegi elizenzakalelayo lokulondoloza/ukushintsha idivayisi"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "If checked, plugin will create automatic tag when device is saved (changed)"
msgstr "Uma kukhethiwe, isengezo sizodala ithegi elizenzakalelayo uma idivayisi ilondolozwa (ishintshwa)"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Device save/change tag color"
msgstr "Umbala wethegi wokulondoloza/ukushintsha idivayisi"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Data source reindex automatic tag"
msgstr "Ithegi elizenzakalelayo lokuhlela kabusha izinkomba zomthombo wedatha"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Create a tag when the set of indexes returned by a device data query changes."
msgstr "Dala ithegi uma isethi yezinkomba ebuyiswa umbuzo wedatha yedivayisi ishintsha."

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Data source reindex tag color"
msgstr "Umbala wethegi wokuhlela kabusha izinkomba zomthombo wedatha"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Automatic tags - others"
msgstr "Amathegi azenzakalelayo - amanye"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Choose how to display tags listed below"
msgstr "Khetha indlela yokubonisa amathegi abhalwe ngezansi"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "For which devices will the tags below displayed?"
msgstr "Azoboniswa kumaphi amadivayisi amathegi angezansi?"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Cacti version automatic tag"
msgstr "Ithegi elizenzakalelayo lenguqulo ye-Cacti"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "If checked, plugin will create automatic tag when Cacti version is changed. Tags is for all graphs."
msgstr "Uma kukhethiwe, isengezo sizodala ithegi elizenzakalelayo uma inguqulo ye-Cacti ishintshiwe. Ithegi elamagrafu wonke."

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Cacti version tag color"
msgstr "Umbala wethegi wenguqulo ye-Cacti"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Poller overrun automatic tag"
msgstr "Ithegi elizenzakalelayo lokweqa kwesikhathi se-poller"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Create a tag when a data collector polling cycle exceeds the configured poller interval."
msgstr "Dala ithegi uma umjikelezo wokuhlola womqoqi wedatha weqa isikhawu se-poller esihleliwe."

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Poller overrun tag color"
msgstr "Umbala wethegi wokweqa kwesikhathi se-poller"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Data collector status automatic tags"
msgstr "Amathegi azenzakalelayo esimweni somqoqi wedatha"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Create tags when a remote data collector goes down or recovers."
msgstr "Dala amathegi uma umqoqi wedatha okude efa noma elulama."

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Data collector status tag color"
msgstr "Umbala wethegi wesimo somqoqi wedatha"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Plugin status automatic tag"
msgstr "Ithegi elizenzakalelayo lesimo sesengezo"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Create a tag when any plugin's status change (enable/disable/upgrade)"
msgstr "Dala ithegi uma isimo sanoma yisiphi isengezo sishintsha (nika amandla/khubaza/thuthukisa)"

#: include/arrays.php
msgid "Plugin state tag color"
msgstr "Umbala wethegi wesimo sesengezo"

